# The server image (server/Dockerfile) and the program runner image (runner/Dockerfile) build from
# the repository root. Allow only what their stages COPY, so that the context does not carry
# node_modules or build output.
*

!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!runner/**
!server/**
!program/**
!crates/**
# The Rust crates of the L2 extensions that the server links.
!extensions/core/remote-input/**
!extensions/aztec/ingest/**
# The verification key of the staging pass, which the image ships with `bb`.
!extensions/core/circuits/staging_pass/compiled/staging_pass.vk
# The server embeds this file with include_str!.
!packages/crisp-contracts/deployed_contracts.json

# Build artifacts
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.git
**/.DS_Store
**/tests/tmp/
**/*.log

# Never send local secrets to an image. These rules come last so that no allow rule above can bring
# a .env file back.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
